# Illustrations Folder

Store illustrations and graphics here.

## Subfolders
- Auth illustrations (registration, login, OTP, etc.)
- Empty states (no data, error, etc.)
- Success illustrations
- Error illustrations

## Files Example
- `auth_illustration_register.png` - Registration illustration
- `auth_illustration_otp.png` - OTP verification illustration
- `empty_state_no_data.png` - No data empty state
- `success_illustration.png` - Success screen illustration

## Usage

```dart
Image.asset('assets/images/illustrations/auth_illustration_register.png')
```
